## MTK constitution — MUST stay tracked.
## Some developers (and some tool defaults) carry a global gitignore that lists AGENTS.md,
## which would silently exclude this repo's constitution. CLAUDE.md is only a shim that
## imports it, so losing AGENTS.md leaves every harness with no rules at all.
## This negation is intentional even if your machine has no such global rule.
!AGENTS.md

## MTK transient artifacts (regenerated per run / machine-local — not shared state)
.claude/analytics.json
.claude/references.index
.claude/rules/triggers.index
.claude/.mtk-cache/
.mtk/
